# PedalFPGA on the DE10-Standard (5CSXFC6D6F31C6).
# Pin locations and I/O standards follow the DE10-Standard user manual; the HPS DDR3 locations
# are where the hard memory controller puts them (locked so the fitter does not have to guess).

